p/DcmXD0iucxb/", "caption": "Your home might not need more of your time. It might need fewer of your decisions.\n\nThink about how many things you decide over and over again:\nWhat\u2019s for dinner? \nWhen should I do laundry? \nWhen am I cleaning this? \nWhere does this go? \nWho\u2019s responsible for that? \nWhat am I forgetting?\nDid they take the trash out?\n\nThose little open decisions add up and they can make home feel much harder to manage than it needs to.\n\nThat\u2019s why I created Making Home Easier, a brand-new 9-day live experience starting September 1.\n\nWe\u2019re going to sit down together and figure out what\u2019s taking up space in your head, make some decisions, create simple rhythms and defaults, and give your home less to ask of you.\n\nThis isn\u2019t about giving you more to do. It\u2019s about giving you less to manage.\n.\nComment EASIER and I\u2019ll send you the link.", "timestamp": "2026-08-28T21:50:38.000Z", "videoDuration": 70.703308, "videoPlayCount": 12332, "videoViewCount": null, "likesCount": 102, "commentsCount": 63, "displayUrl": "https://scontent-cdg6-1.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.82787-15/785284506_18624238513038124_283772899078205447_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e15_tt6&_nc_cat=105&ig_cache_key=Mzk3Mzk2NTEzODg0NjQwMzY3NTE4NjI0MjM4NTEwMDM4MTI0.3-ccb7-5&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=58cdad&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6IkNMSVBTLnhwaWRzLjExMjUuc2RyLnZpZGVvX2RlZmF1bHRfY292ZXJfZnJhbWUuQzMifQ%3D%3D&_nc_ohc=T76VRJK5vccQ7kNvwFmiuPP&_nc_oc=AdpV1dfZDj5TFSACUHqWSS5p_aux0qbGU6FTpwPerIwrX1fgs7l9hf_V6qchRr6YBvaYKdTHagp0lk4cxfyk767v&_nc_ad=z-m&_nc_cid=0&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scontent-cdg6-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_gid=CclLHZVDhaS7Uoi2kz4ZXg&_nc_ss=7a22e&oh=00_AQLQlQSX8lsNGFLgdjE11nBF_X-GN-4iUjrOOSHTTiGMLw&oe=6AB5B218", "videoUrl": "https://scontent-cdg4-1.cdninstagram.com/o1/v/t2/f2/m86/AQNTDw0yjsqOXbjaWLM1giEnr_xEbQTtgWmMjczFE-6HgmOMKqFEPTeqvQBXQwFW0L7qthhaUrX4Zd-9f8IpW8qMxXdi1OoEftaUgH8.mp4?_nc_cat=108&_nc_sid=5e9851&_nc_ht=scontent-cdg4-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_ohc=op6afXr4DIIQ7kNvwEW8ypz&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6Inhwdl9wcm9ncmVzc2l2ZS5JTlNUQUdSQU0uQ0xJUFMuQzMuNzIwLmRhc2hfYmFzZWxpbmVfMV92MSIsInhwdl9hc3NldF9pZCI6MTc3Mjc3MzY1NzI1OTAxMiwiYXNzZXRfYWdlX2RheXMiOjIyLCJ2aV91c2VjYXNlX2lkIjoxMDA5OSwiZHVyYXRpb25fcyI6NzAsInVybGdlbl9zb3VyY2UiOiJ3d3cifQ%3D%3D&ccb=17-1&vs=e7eaa59576a87d6a&_nc_&_nc_gid=CclLHZVDhaS7Uoi2kz4ZXg&_nc_ss=7a22e&_nc_zt=28&oh=00_AQKzjGfoCEoJg7JQr5FASi1kYH3YVvsPDOFIuEntDWhCEg&oe=6AB1D425", "musicInfo": {"artist_name": "cleanmama", "song_name": "Original audio", "uses_original_audio": true, "should_mute_audio": false, "should_mute_audio_reason": "", "audio_id": "28233236212962164"}, "ownerUsername": "cleanmama", "ownerFullName": "Clean Mama\u00ae", "history": [{"date": "2026-08-30", "plays": 8437, "likes": 71, "comments": 39}, {"date": "2026-09-06", "plays": 11114, "likes": 99, "comments": 61}, {"date": "2026-09-13", "plays": 12148, "likes": 101, "comments": 61}, {"date": "2026-09-20", "plays": 12332, "likes": 102, "comments": 63}], "still_climbing": false, "transcript": "Your home might not be taking all of your time, but it might be taking all of your thoughts. If you feel like you're constantly thinking about your house or what you need to do, what's for dinner, what am I doing laundry, what didn't I do, what did I do, where does this go, who's handling that, did someone take the garbage out, did I start the dishwasher, when am I going to clean this? We make those same household decisions over and over again, and I think it's one of the reasons that home can feel so overwhelming. Every decision that you leave open becomes something you have to keep managing. Personally, I haven't decided when to wash my sheets in over 20 years because I do that on Saturdays. That decision has been made. I created something completely new. It's called Making Home Easier, and for nine days we're going to sit down together and figure out the rhythms, defaults, systems, and decisions that can make your home require less of you. I'm not giving you more to do. We're figuring out what you can stop managing. I hope you join me. Comment easier, and I will send you the link. We start on September 1st. Get in now.", "is_relevant": true, "hook_type": "Problem"}, {"shortCode": "DcfGQlvNodT", "url": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DcfGQlvNodT/", "caption": "Tell me I\u2019m not the only one\u2026.\nOther family members know how to load, unload and run the dishwasher. So why does it still feel like it\u2019s mine?\n\nDoing a task and owning a task aren\u2019t the same thing. Owning it means noticing it needs to happen, doing it, and finishing it \u2014 all three, without a check-in from me.\n\nIf I\u2019m still the one noticing it\u2019s full, reminding them to run it, and checking that they did? I\u2019m still the owner. The dishwasher just has an assistant.\n\n\u2714\ufe0fWhat\u2019s something in your house you\u2019re technically not doing, but you\u2019re still the one running?", "timestamp": "2026-08-26T02:08:13.000Z", "videoDuration": 14.046621, "videoPlayCount": 18272, "videoViewCount": null, "likesCount": 84, "commentsCount": 1, "displayUrl": "https://instagram.ffab1-2.fna.fbcdn.net/v/t15.5256-10/786121722_1532373091536851_4071725445781902997_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e15_tt6&_nc_cat=104&ig_cache_key=Mzk3MTkyMDkyNDY3NTMxMTQ0Mw%3D%3D.3-ccb7-5&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=58cdad&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6IkNMSVBTLnhwaWRzLjY0MC5zZHIudmlkZW9fZGVmYXVsdF9jb3Zlcl9mcmFtZS5DMyJ9&_nc_ohc=tjTqfoHzLFEQ7kNvwEHORJh&_nc_oc=AdoB_TPbrPnGPz_1F_jEShNl5P_khh7BvpPcnUjl6SX4TKz_qN507nHLinixZxDI3KPMl3H-7F8E637TDnoVVlk5&_nc_ad=z-m&_nc_cid=0&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=instagram.ffab1-2.fna&_nc_gid=o_yyP1e4E02v6nb3HDqitw&_nc_ss=7a22e&oh=00_AQLoYrn67vfiYQtGQcgsuPUxMK-xMj3x6FjuwqtPO82Reg&oe=6AB5C20C", "videoUrl": "https://instagram.ffab1-1.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t16/f2/m84/AQNQ5HbKg4vARcYpG1J_etdGMvoX1sX1noTXGN1Cg2n9gQB-uB_rRNvVn18DdykZR9p7TWqyDDW6XVI32X0_Rz8wj7HtO2XRr6H0AuM.mp4?_nc_cat=111&_nc_oc=AdpdhBHkeQPpDKV7N-WKskXIjI48C7zm5HsCDSyibO4Q7fF3rNkn1PXOr7uUMoH-PVNJRBEMC7DYSCJo8fATnz